AwwO builds this pinned open-source core on demand; enterprise/ is excluded.
The upstream runtime is modified at build time by apps/openmaus-worker/setup.ts:
the OpenAI-compatible driver has computer use disabled; tool mounting is
restricted to the fixed awwo_workspace MCP; agents and connector capabilities
are disabled. The original source is not represented as AwwO-authored code.
